          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On March 1, 1978, two witnesses in their vehicle observed a bright object moving slowly from south to north in the sky around 6:30 PM. The observation lasted 7 to 8 minutes. The object was long and bulky; it was primarily red in color. No unusual noises were heard. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon was collected, for which we have limited information.",
